{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54063","headline":"栽松颂 · 师虔","name":"栽松颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"短短一尺余（《景德传灯录》、《五灯会元》、《古今禅藻集》均作「长长三尺余」），纤纤（前引三书均作「郁郁」）覆绿（《景德传灯录》作「荒」，《五灯会元》、《古今禅藻集》作「青」）草。\n不知何世（前引三书均作「代」）人，得见此松老。\n（见《祖堂集》卷八，以《景德传灯录》卷十七、《五灯会元》卷十三、《古今禅藻集》卷七对校）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"师虔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54063.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54063","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}